lf-reviewed","noviceReadability":"pending-user-sampling","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"74c9908d"},{"id":"fiction-history-modern-literature::first-four-histories","scope":"humanities-history","groupId":"fiction-history-modern-literature","groupTitle":"史学著作","groupTakeaway":"史学著作知识按著作基本信息、史书组合和内部体例展开。先区分作者与史书体裁，再说明二十四史、前四史、《史记》体例和《春秋》三传。","title":"前四史","content":"前四史包括《史记》《汉书》《后汉书》《三国志》。四部史书都采用纪传体，但作者、时代和记述对象各不相同。","label":"前四史","note":"前四史包括《史记》《汉书》《后汉书》《三国志》。四部史书都采用纪传体，但作者、时代和记述对象各不相同。","learningGoal":"准确说出前四史的四部著作。","productionMode":"reuse","productionLabel":"直接复用","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"fiction-history-modern-literature","tabId":"historiography-works","sourceUnitIds":["cs-10-15-p9-historiography-table"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=fiction-history-modern-literature&tabId=historiography-works","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"pending-user-sampling","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"a03001b0"}]